		</section>

		<!-- maker -->
		<section class="section wrap maker" aria-labelledby="maker-title">
			<div class="maker__card">
				<Mark size={52} class="maker__mark" />
				<div class="maker__body">
					<h2 class="maker__title" id="maker-title">Made by Levon Arakelyan, in the open.</h2>
					<p class="maker__text">
						Matenadar started out of stubbornness—wanting a single, honest layout engine good enough to typeset real print books
						without dragging in headless Chrome or locking manuscripts inside a proprietary editor. Named after the Matenadaran (<span
							class="hy"
							lang="hy">Մատենադարան</span
